      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "03 - SDXL + ControlNet Union Canny for Mac Studio M2 Max 32GB.\nDefault input: input/body.jpg -> resized to 896x1152 -> Canny edge map.\nControlNet: models/controlnet/controlnet_union_sdxl.safetensors, union type canny/lineart/anime_lineart/mlsd.\nDefault: strength 0.75, start 0.0, end 0.85, dpmpp_2m + karras, 20 steps, cfg 6.0.\nMeasured on this server: first tested run completed in about 62 seconds and produced output/sdxl_controlnet_canny_m2max_00001_.png.\nFast draft option: lower steps to 16 or reduce canvas to 832x1088. If pose control is too rigid, lower strength to 0.60-0.65 or end to 0.70-0.75.\nUse this when you want a new image that follows an input photo's pose, silhouette, object outline, or composition."
      ]
    }
